      "body": "Chennai Petroleum Corporation Limited has appointed Shri S.G. Venkatesh (DIN: 0008823140) as Director (Technical) on the Board of CPCL effective from the afternoon of January 5, 2026. Shri S.G.Venkatesh was holding the position of Executive Director (Petrochemicals), IOCL. He holds a Bachelor's Degree in Chemical Engineering from University of Kerala. Mr. S G Venkatesh is a results- driven Chemical Engineer with 31 years of experience specializing in petroleum refining operations, process design & optimization and petrochemicals and is responsible for spearheading the company's entire petrochemical business, driving revenue growth, and leading the strategic direction for a diverse portfolio of commodity and specialty chemicals. His career trajectory is distinguished by a strong foundation ",
